        "rationale": "The agent retrieved mean gas values via iot.sensor_stats for Transformer 1 at MAIN (window confirmed from first/last timestamps, 2024-01-15 to 2024-01-19), fetched the failure mode list via fmsr.get_failure_modes, and reported that fmsr.interpret_dga returned 'LLM unavailable' before computing the IEC 60599 ratios manually. The ratio values (C2H2/C2H4\u22480.0004, CH4/H2\u22482.56, C2H4/C2H6\u22483.05) and Duval Triangle 1 percentages (\u224830.6% CH4, 69.4% C2H4, 0.03% C2H2 \u2192 T3) are arithmetically correct from th",
